# TyCon migration regression: verify Seq evaluation works after Type::Seq→App(TyCon("Seq")) migration.
--- uses: ["core"]
# S-842 replaced Type::Seq(T) with Type::seq() helper at ~285 match sites.
# Seq must be collected before length() can be called (length operates on Dict/materialized Seq).
[
  xs: [collect [seq 1 [seq 2 [seq 3 [builtin-variant "Seq.Nil"]]]]]
  n: [length xs]
]
=== out
Dict({"xs": Dict({0: Int(1), 1: Int(2), 2: Int(3)}), "n": Int(3)})
